Bundle-Name: Model Atlas Scope API — read-only EObject registry contract
Bundle-Description: Read-only contract (ScopedEObjectsRegistry) for the resolved, \
 final-stage view of a single (scope, registry), depending only on EMF core. The \
 stage-explicit write/inspect operations live on the workflow API; this bundle is \
 what read-only consumers (validation, remote clients) depend on.

-library: enableEMF

src=${^src},src-gen

# The code generation takes a bit of time and makes the build a bit slower.
# It might be a good idea to put comments around it, when you don't need it
-generate:\
	model/scope-api.genmodel;\
		generate=fennecEMF;\
		genmodel=model/scope-api.genmodel;\
		output=src-gen
		
# Add this attribute to find some logging information
#		logfile=test.log;\

# If this is not done with a instruction namespace, bnd would think you like
# to take full control over whats exported and imported and will ignore @Export
# Bundle Annotations		
-includeresource.model: model=model
